# W4 follow-up: the provider refuses the third turn's request as too large
# for the window (`provider_overflow`, `orchestrator.zig:8099-8124`). Two
# text-only turns before it, so the compaction needs no notes: the refused
# request is sent again once with the compacted form of the older turn.
gateway compact-overflow-turns.json
wait 3
type first question
key Enter
wait 2.5
type second question
key Enter
wait 2.5
type third question
key Enter
wait 3
snap answered
gwlog
